---
version: 2
id: group-inspect
requires: [group, messages, next]
---
Group state: {{group.state}}
A completed task means the assigned mate returned a report; it does not imply independent verification.
Mates:
@for mate in group.mates
- {{mate.id}}: {{mate.responsibility}}
@endfor
Tasks:
@if nonempty(group.nodes)
@for node in group.nodes
@include group-node
@endfor
@else
- (none)
@endif
Messages are historical observations; task state above is authoritative.
New mate messages:
@if nonempty(messages)
@for message in messages
- seq={{message.sequence}} sender={{message.sender}} type={{message.type}}
@if nonempty(message.dispatch)
dispatch={{message.dispatch}} currentDispatch={{message.current}}
@else
dispatch=(uncorrelated) currentDispatch={{message.current}}
@endif
payload={{message.payload}}
@endfor
@else
- (none)
@endif
nextSinceSeq: {{next}}
